── verdict in the wrong case
exit 2
feov-record: verdict: --as takes one of PASS|FAIL, not "pass": it differs from "PASS" only in case. A PASS is checked against the open board by exact match, so any other spelling skips the check entirely and records an unadjudicated pass

    PASS  nothing on the board holds the gate — `show work` marks what does, and a refused PASS names every one — and this is CHECKED against the board, not taken on your word
    FAIL  the board, as it stands, still stops you — refused over a converged board

